			<item>
				<title> CoreWeave在收到现金之前就出售其人工智能产能</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/coreweave-selling-capacity-before-cash/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/coreweave-selling-capacity-before-cash/</guid>
				<description>CoreWeave 报告 20.8 亿美元季度收入和 994 亿美元积压订单,但面临核心挑战:必须在现金到账前构建产能,承受巨额资本支出(310-350 亿美元)和融资压力,积压订单转化缓慢。</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>用第一性原理思考：无需追流量，做好内容就能在平台获利</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/%E7%94%A8%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%80%A7%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E6%80%9D%E8%80%83%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8/</link>
